# Copy to .env and fill in your key:  cp .env.example .env
#
# Without a key the game still runs — it falls back to bundled stories and the
# bundled scene artwork. With one, every story beat and background is generated.
#
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
#
# Note: VITE_* variables are inlined into the client bundle, so this key ships
# to every player's browser. Fine for local play and demos; put the calls behind
# a backend function before deploying anything public. Setting a spend limit on
# the key is worthwhile either way — image generation costs materially more per
# call than text.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here
